<ComponentPreview name="p-meter-1" />

## Installation

<InstallCommand
  pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui @hugeicons/svelte @hugeicons/core-free-icons"
  shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/meter.json"
/>

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Meter } from "@coss-sv/ui";
</script>
```

## API Reference

The Svelte port preserves the COSS styling and forwards native attributes to the rendered element. See the [Shards Meter API](https://shardsui.com/svelte/meter) for primitive behavior and part props.

